Program
  Squad Point
    Field x npc yap
    Field y npc yap
  Squad Circle
    Field center Point yap
    Field radius npc canon
  Decl c Circle yap
    SquadInit
      SquadInit
        Number 3
        Number 4
      Number 10
  FieldAssign c.center.x
    BinOp +
      FieldAccess x
        FieldAccess center
          Var c
      Number 7
  Print
    FieldAccess x
      FieldAccess center
        Var c
  Print
    Var c
  Exit
    Number 0
